00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:18.740
Cool.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.730
So now that's colored correctly.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:24.980
There's the
not-in-word, I believe,

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:28.590
