00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.640
Yeah, not-in-word.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:34.680
So the other letters here.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:36.210
not-in-word.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.895
Background color,
call lightgrey.

00:20:40.895 --> 00:20:42.270
I think I did it
