where light gray does
not have a hyphen.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.690
Let's fix this indentation.

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:49.965
But it's just one single word.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.570
Wonderful.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:57.820
So we can get rid of
that border that's

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:00.550
getting really distracting.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:05.010
And then, we should probably
