00:25:25.560 --> 00:25:29.280
apply to the guess-letters that
are a child of this results

00:25:29.280 --> 00:25:31.020
div.

00:25:31.020 --> 00:25:31.700
Oof.

00:25:31.700 --> 00:25:32.285
Oh, wait.

00:25:32.285 --> 00:25:32.980
We get this now.

00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:34.020
So that's not great.

00:25:37.080 --> 00:25:42.120
