00:26:10.490 --> 00:26:21.340
span X, class equals
guess-letter and in-word.

00:26:21.340 --> 00:26:24.025
That's the class, comma.

00:26:28.095 --> 00:26:28.595
Cool.

00:26:35.350 --> 00:26:39.468
So that now our legend matches.

