So actually, you know what?

00:28:08.940 --> 00:28:10.620
Maybe first, we will--

00:28:10.620 --> 00:28:12.000
right now,
everything's shoved up

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:13.650
against the left of
the screen, but I

00:28:13.650 --> 00:28:21.430
think that's a little
